    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pi9w](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pi9w) Magnitude 7.1 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jan 07 2025 26km E of Tingri. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 28.639 longitude 87.3608. It impacted 19366 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
